  "title": "Taunted by the Tusken Child",
  "description": "Officially a prisoner of the Tusken Raider tribe, Boba Fett sat tied to a petrified tree slab, continuing to bake beneath the scorching Tatooine suns. Head slunk and sleeping, Fett was awakened by the abrupt jabs of a young Tusken, who appeared as curious as they were bold. With Boba raising up his head, other Tusken youth begin to gather around him. Having made eye contact with the first youth, the young raider attacked Fett with a gaffi stick, and the others soon followed, attracting the attention of some of the tribe's elder members."
}
